# A 45-module-<name>.preset in files/ is how a module enables/disables its
# own units (systemctl is stubbed during the build, so you can't call it in
# module.sh). 99-finalize.sh applies ONLY 45-module-*.preset files, so
# delisting the module removes its enablement with it. User units go under
# usr/lib/systemd/user-preset/ instead (see core/brew).
enable example.service
